  fatigue["Fatigue evolution<br/>Hazard; irreversible history at G"]
  observation["FE-to-DIC observation<br/>Shape functions; irregular Q; covariance"]
  inverse["Identifiability / inversion<br/>Whitened Jacobian; SVD; TRF"]
  belief["Sequential belief<br/>Prefix MAP / optional Graph + GRU"]
  correction["Physics-guided correction<br/>A/m refit or bounded low-dimensional law"]
  forecast["Future open-loop prediction<br/>Rebuild history; solve FEM at new D"]
  scope["Synthetic research scope<br/>Truth: generation / evaluation only<br/>RL NO-GO; no validated crack path / RUL"]
